  function attachTecQuestionRecords(){const match=createQuestionNotebookMatcher(S()),changes=[];for(const record of S().history){if(record.questionNotebookId||record.kind!=='study'||record.externalSource?.provider!=='tec')continue;const book=match(record).match;if(book)changes.push([record,book.id]);}if(!changes.length)return;try{save(()=>{for(const [record,id]of changes)record.questionNotebookId=id;});}catch(cause){api.toast('Não foi possível salvar os vínculos do TEC: '+cause.message);}}
  function pendingTecNotebookLinks(){const match=createQuestionNotebookMatcher(S()),groups=new Map();for(const record of S().history){if(record.questionNotebookId||record.kind!=='study'||record.externalSource?.provider!=='tec'||questionSubject&&record.subjectId!==questionSubject)continue;const {candidates}=match(record);if(candidates.length<2)continue;const id=JSON.stringify([record.subjectId,questionTopicKey(record.topic)]);if(!groups.has(id))groups.set(id,{id,subjectId:record.subjectId,topic:record.topic,records:[],candidates});groups.get(id).records.push(record);}return [...groups.values()];}
  function pendingTecNotebookMarkup(){const groups=pendingTecNotebookLinks();if(!groups.length)return '';return `<details class="panel question-tec-links" open><summary><strong>${groups.reduce((n,g)=>n+g.records.length,0)} registros do TEC precisam da escolha do caderno</strong></summary><p class="note">O tópico aparece em mais de uma aula ou caderno. Escolha onde os registros devem entrar; os totais gerais já os incluem.</p>${groups.map(group=>{const result=totals(group.records);return `<div class="question-tec-link-row" data-tec-notebook-group="${esc(group.id)}" data-tec-notebook-exam="${esc(S().activeExamId)}"><div><strong>${esc(group.topic)}</strong><small>${esc(S().subjects.find(m=>m.id===group.subjectId)?.name||group.records[0].name)} · ${result.total} questões · ${result.correct} acertos · ${result.wrong} erros</small></div><label>Caderno / aula<select data-tec-notebook-choice aria-label="Escolher caderno para ${esc(group.topic)}"><option value="">Escolha o destino</option>${group.candidates.map(book=>`<option value="${esc(book.id)}">${esc((book.course||'Cadernos de questões')+' — '+book.title)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><button type="button" data-tec-notebook-bind>Vincular registros</button></div>`;}).join('')}</details>`;}
  document.addEventListener('click',event=>{const button=event.target.closest('[data-tec-notebook-bind]');if(!button)return;const row=button.closest('[data-tec-notebook-group]');if(row.dataset.tecNotebookExam!==S().activeExamId)return api.toast('A prova mudou. Atualize a lista.');const group=pendingTecNotebookLinks().find(g=>g.id===row.dataset.tecNotebookGroup),selected=row.querySelector('[data-tec-notebook-choice]').value;if(!group||!group.candidates.some(b=>b.id===selected))return api.toast('Escolha uma aula ou caderno compatível com a matéria e o tópico.');try{save(()=>{for(const record of group.records)record.questionNotebookId=selected;});render();api.toast('Registros vinculados sem duplicar questões ou tempo.');}catch(cause){api.toast(cause.message);}});
  function renderQuestions(){attachTecQuestionRecords();if(questionExam!==S().activeExamId){questionExam=S().activeExamId;questionSubject='';questionSearch='';questionStatusFilter='all';questionOpenSubjects.clear();questionOpenCourses.clear();}const history=questionHistory().filter(h=>!questionSubject||h.subjectId===questionSubject),stats=totals(history),q=key(questionSearch),all=notebooks().filter(b=>(!questionSubject||b.subjectId===questionSubject)&&(!q||key([b.title,b.course,b.topic,b.notes].join(' ')).includes(q))),books=all.filter(b=>questionStatusFilter==='all'||questionBookStatus(b)===questionStatusFilter);$('pageTitle').textContent='Controle de questões';$('pageDescription').textContent='Matérias, materiais e aulas ou cadernos de questões.';$('content').innerHTML=`<section class="question-control">${learningBack()}<div class="panel-title"><div><h2>Questões</h2><p>Organize suas aulas e cadernos por matéria e material.</p></div><div class="actions"><button type="button" data-question-add-matter>＋ Matéria</button><button type="button" class="primary" data-question-add ${subjects().length?'':'disabled'}>＋ Aula / caderno</button><button type="button" data-question-import-topics ${subjects().length?'':'disabled'}>＋ Tópicos · colar do TEC</button></div></div><div class="theory-metrics">${[['Questões resolvidas',stats.total],['Acertos',stats.correct],['Erros',stats.wrong],['Aproveitamento',accuracy(stats.accuracy)]].map(([label,value])=>`<div class="theory-metric"><span>${label}</span><strong>${value}</strong></div>`).join('')}</div><p class="note">${totals(history.filter(h=>api.dayKey(new Date(h.date))===today())).total} questões hoje · O resumo inclui todos os estudos de questões desta prova.</p><div class="theory-toolbar"><label>Matéria<select id="questionSubjectFilter"><option value="">Todas as matérias</option>${subjectOptions(questionSubject)}</select></label><label>Buscar aula, caderno ou material<input id="questionSearch" type="search" value="${esc(questionSearch)}" placeholder="Aula 00, CESGRANRIO, material…"></label></div><div class="theory-status-filters question-status-filters" role="group" aria-label="Estado das aulas e cadernos">${[['all','Todos'],['pending','Não iniciados'],['active','Andamento'],['completed','Concluídos']].map(([status,label])=>`<button type="button" data-question-status="${status}" aria-pressed="${questionStatusFilter===status}">${label} <span>${status==='all'?all.length:all.filter(b=>questionBookStatus(b)===status).length}</span></button>`).join('')}</div>${pendingTecNotebookMarkup()}<div class="question-subject-groups">${questionTree(books)||'<div class="theory-empty"><h3>Nenhuma aula ou caderno neste filtro</h3><p>Adicione uma aula ou caderno e organize por matéria e material.</p></div>'}</div><p class="note">Os registros do TEC são vinculados por matéria, tópico e caderno de origem. Registros antigos sem identificação do caderno permanecem no total geral da raiz. Os resultados das linhas consideram os registros da respectiva aula ou caderno. Cada registro entra uma única vez no Histórico e nas Estatísticas.</p></section>`;$('questionSubjectFilter').onchange=e=>{questionSubject=e.target.value;render();};$('questionSearch').oninput=e=>{const position=e.target.selectionStart;questionSearch=e.target.value;render();$('questionSearch').focus();try{$('questionSearch').setSelectionRange(position,position);}catch{}};}
  document.addEventListener('toggle',event=>{const node=event.target;if(!node.isConnected)return;if(node.matches?.('[data-question-subject]')){const id=node.dataset.questionSubject;if(node.open)questionOpenSubjects.add(id);else questionOpenSubjects.delete(id);}if(node.matches?.('[data-question-course]')){const id=node.dataset.questionCourse;if(node.open)questionOpenCourses.add(id);else questionOpenCourses.delete(id);}},true);
  document.addEventListener('click',event=>{const complete=event.target.closest('[data-question-complete]');if(complete){const book=notebooks().find(b=>b.id===complete.dataset.questionComplete);if(book)try{save(()=>{book.completed=true;book.updatedAt=new Date().toISOString();});render();}catch(e){api.toast(e.message);}return;}const status=event.target.closest('[data-question-status]');if(status){questionStatusFilter=status.dataset.questionStatus;render();return;}if(event.target.closest('[data-question-add-matter]'))return openQuestionSubjects();const subjectAdd=event.target.closest('[data-question-add-subject]');if(subjectAdd){openNotebook();$('questionNotebookSubject').value=subjectAdd.dataset.questionAddSubject;return;}const review=event.target.closest('[data-question-review]');if(review){const book=notebooks().find(b=>b.id===review.dataset.questionReview);if(book)api.scheduleQuestionReview?.(book);}});

  const topicImportDialog=document.createElement('dialog');topicImportDialog.id='questionTopicImportDialog';topicImportDialog.className='theory-dialog';topicImportDialog.innerHTML=`<div class="dialog-head"><h2>Adicionar tópicos — colar do TEC</h2><button type="button" data-close="questionTopicImportDialog" aria-label="Fechar importação de tópicos">✕</button></div><form id="questionTopicImportForm"><div class="theory-form-grid"><label>Matéria<select id="questionTopicImportSubject" required></select></label><label>Curso ou material<input id="questionTopicImportCourse" maxlength="200" required placeholder="Ex.: TEC · CESGRANRIO"></label></div><label>Link do caderno<input id="questionTopicImportUrl" type="url" maxlength="2000" placeholder="https://www.tecconcursos.com.br/questoes/cadernos/…"></label><label>Cole a lista de tópicos do TEC<textarea id="questionTopicImportText" rows="9" maxlength="150000" placeholder="Administração Indireta&#10;12 (6.67%)&#10;Desapropriação&#10;11 (6.11%)"></textarea></label><p class="note">Reconhece tópico, quantidade e percentual em linhas separadas ou na mesma linha. A quantidade do TEC é uma referência e não será lançada como questões resolvidas.</p><p id="questionTopicImportSummary" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="questionTopicImportPreview" class="question-topic-import-preview"></div><p id="questionTopicImportError" class="form-error" role="alert" hidden></p><p class="note">Se o tópico já existir na mesma matéria e material, somente sua quantidade de referência e incidência serão atualizadas. Os resultados, metas e observações permanecem.</p><div class="dialog-actions"><button type="button" data-close="questionTopicImportDialog">Cancelar</button><button class="primary" id="questionTopicImportSave" disabled>Importar tópicos</button></div></form>`;document.body.append(topicImportDialog);let topicImportExam='';
  function previewTecTopics(){const parsed=parseTecTopics($('questionTopicImportText').value);$('questionTopicImportSummary').textContent=parsed.rows.length+' tópicos reconhecidos · '+parsed.rows.reduce((n,r)=>n+r.referenceQuestions,0)+' questões de referência'+(parsed.duplicates?' · '+parsed.duplicates+' tópicos repetidos ignorados':'');$('questionTopicImportPreview').innerHTML=parsed.rows.length?`<table><thead><tr><th>Tópico</th><th>Questões de referência</th><th>Incidência</th></tr></thead><tbody>${parsed.rows.map(row=>`<tr><td>${esc(row.topic)}</td><td>${row.referenceQuestions}</td><td>${row.incidence.toLocaleString('pt-BR',{minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2})}%</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table>`:'';$('questionTopicImportError').hidden=!parsed.errors.length;$('questionTopicImportError').textContent=parsed.errors.join(' ');$('questionTopicImportSave').disabled=!parsed.rows.length||!!parsed.errors.length;return parsed;}
  function openTopicImport(subjectId=null){topicImportExam=S().activeExamId;$('questionTopicImportForm').reset();$('questionTopicImportSubject').innerHTML=subjectOptions(subjectId||questionSubject);$('questionTopicImportCourse').value='TEC — Tópicos por incidência';previewTecTopics();topicImportDialog.showModal();}
  $('questionTopicImportText').addEventListener('input',previewTecTopics);
  $('questionTopicImportForm').onsubmit=event=>{event.preventDefault();if(!topicImportDialog.open)return;const parsed=previewTecTopics(),subjectId=$('questionTopicImportSubject').value,course=clean($('questionTopicImportCourse').value),rawUrl=clean($('questionTopicImportUrl').value),matter=S().subjects.find(m=>m.id===subjectId);if(topicImportExam!==S().activeExamId)return error('questionTopicImportError','A prova mudou. Abra a importação novamente.');if(!matter||!course||course.length>200||!parsed.rows.length||parsed.errors.length)return error('questionTopicImportError',parsed.errors.join(' ')||'Escolha a matéria, informe o material e cole os tópicos.');if(rawUrl&&!safeUrl(rawUrl))return error('questionTopicImportError','Informe um link válido começando com https:// ou http://.');let added=0,updated=0;try{save(()=>{S().questionNotebooks??=[];const group=notebooks().filter(b=>b.subjectId===subjectId&&(b.course||'Cadernos de questões')===course),byTopic=new Map(group.map(b=>[key(b.topic||b.title).replace(/\s+/g,' '),b])),newCount=parsed.rows.filter(row=>!byTopic.has(key(row.topic).replace(/\s+/g,' '))).length;if(notebooks().length+newCount>5000)throw Error('O controle permite até 5000 aulas, cadernos ou tópicos por prova.');const courseUrl=safeUrl(rawUrl)||questionDestinationUrl(subjectId,course);if(courseUrl)for(const book of group)book.courseUrl=courseUrl;for(const row of parsed.rows){const old=byTopic.get(key(row.topic).replace(/\s+/g,' ')),metadata={referenceQuestions:row.referenceQuestions,incidence:row.incidence,incidencePriority:row.incidencePriority,updatedAt:new Date().toISOString()};if(old){Object.assign(old,metadata);updated++;}else{const book={id:api.uid(),subjectId,subjectName:matter.name,title:row.topic.length>300?row.topic.slice(0,297)+'…':row.topic,topic:row.topic,kind:'topic',course,courseOrder:questionDestinationOrder(subjectId,course,null),courseUrl,target:null,resourceUrl:'',notes:'',completed:false,...metadata};S().questionNotebooks.push(book);added++;}}S().questionSubjectIds=[...new Set([...(S().questionSubjectIds||[]),subjectId])];});questionOpenSubjects.add(subjectId);questionOpenCourses.add(JSON.stringify([subjectId,course]));questionSubject='';questionSearch='';questionStatusFilter='all';topicImportDialog.close();render();api.toast(added+' tópicos adicionados · '+updated+' atualizados.');}catch(cause){error('questionTopicImportError',cause.message);}};
